<svg width="100%" viewBox="0 0 680 390" role="img" style="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title style="fill:rgb(0, 0, 0);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:start;dominant-baseline:auto">研究方法流程與所用公式</title><desc style="fill:rgb(0, 0, 0);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:start;dominant-baseline:auto">現場資料包含兩趟合力撿拾與五人分開快篩，於六條路段重複執行。兩趟撿拾推出合力偵測率與真實總數 N。結合五人快篩得到每人的偵測率與修正係數，導出三項結論：分路況的修正係數、觀察者間的離散度、以及比較預測值與實測值的獨立性檢驗。</desc>
<defs><marker id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M2 1L8 5L2 9" fill="none" stroke="context-stroke" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></marker></defs>

<text x="140" y="86" text-anchor="end" style="fill:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;text-anchor:end;dominant-baseline:auto">現場資料</text>
<text x="140" y="104" text-anchor="end" style="fill:rgb(82, 81, 78);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:end;dominant-baseline:auto">（六條街）</text>
<rect x="155" y="62" width="210" height="48" rx="4" stroke-width="0.5" style="fill:rgb(225, 245, 238);stroke:rgb(15, 110, 86);color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:0.5px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:start;dominant-baseline:auto"/>
<text x="260" y="84" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:rgb(82, 81, 78);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:auto">兩趟合力撿拾</text>
<text x="260" y="102" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:rgb(82, 81, 78);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:auto">T₁ 、 T₂</text>
<rect x="390" y="62" width="210" height="48" rx="4" stroke-width="0.5" style="fill:rgb(225, 245, 238);stroke:rgb(15, 110, 86);color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:0.5px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:start;dominant-baseline:auto"/>
<text x="495" y="84" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:rgb(82, 81, 78);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:auto">五人分開快篩</text>
<text x="495" y="102" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:rgb(82, 81, 78);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:auto">s₁ – s₅</text>

<text x="140" y="170" text-anchor="end" style="fill:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;text-anchor:end;dominant-baseline:auto">推算總數</text>
<rect x="155" y="142" width="210" height="48" rx="4" stroke-width="0.5" style="fill:rgb(252, 252, 251);stroke:color(srgb 0.0431373 0.0431373 0.0431373 / 0.2);color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:0.5px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:start;dominant-baseline:auto"/>
<text x="260" y="164" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:rgb(82, 81, 78);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:auto">p_team = 1 − T₂ / T₁</text>
<text x="260" y="182" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:rgb(82, 81, 78);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:auto">公式 ⑫</text>
<rect x="390" y="142" width="210" height="48" rx="4" stroke-width="0.5" style="fill:rgb(252, 252, 251);stroke:color(srgb 0.0431373 0.0431373 0.0431373 / 0.2);color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:0.5px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:start;dominant-baseline:auto"/>
<text x="495" y="164" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:rgb(82, 81, 78);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:auto">N = T₁ / p_team</text>
<text x="495" y="182" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:rgb(82, 81, 78);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:auto">公式 ① ②</text>

<text x="140" y="248" text-anchor="end" style="fill:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;text-anchor:end;dominant-baseline:auto">個人係數</text>
<rect x="155" y="220" width="445" height="48" rx="4" stroke-width="0.5" style="fill:rgb(252, 252, 251);stroke:color(srgb 0.0431373 0.0431373 0.0431373 / 0.2);color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:0.5px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:start;dominant-baseline:auto"/>
<text x="377" y="242" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:rgb(82, 81, 78);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:auto">pⱼ = sⱼ / N          kⱼ = N / sⱼ</text>
<text x="377" y="260" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:rgb(82, 81, 78);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:auto">公式 ⑪</text>

<text x="140" y="338" text-anchor="end" style="fill:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;text-anchor:end;dominant-baseline:auto">三項結論</text>
<rect x="155" y="298" width="137" height="72" rx="4" stroke-width="0.5" style="fill:rgb(252, 252, 251);stroke:color(srgb 0.0431373 0.0431373 0.0431373 / 0.2);color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:0.5px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:start;dominant-baseline:auto"/>
<text x="223" y="320" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:rgb(82, 81, 78);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:auto">修正係數 k̄</text>
<text x="223" y="338" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:rgb(82, 81, 78);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:auto">分路況呈現</text>
<text x="223" y="356" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:rgb(82, 81, 78);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:auto">公式 ⑯</text>

<rect x="309" y="298" width="137" height="72" rx="4" stroke-width="0.5" style="fill:rgb(252, 252, 251);stroke:color(srgb 0.0431373 0.0431373 0.0431373 / 0.2);color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:0.5px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:start;dominant-baseline:auto"/>
<text x="377" y="320" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:rgb(82, 81, 78);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:auto">離散度 IQR</text>
<text x="377" y="338" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:rgb(82, 81, 78);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:auto">觀察者間差異</text>
<text x="377" y="356" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:rgb(82, 81, 78);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:auto">公式 ⑰</text>

<rect x="463" y="298" width="137" height="72" rx="4" stroke-width="0.5" style="fill:rgb(252, 252, 251);stroke:color(srgb 0.0431373 0.0431373 0.0431373 / 0.2);color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:0.5px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:start;dominant-baseline:auto"/>
